Dushyant_yadav : who is tony stark
EDITH : Tony Stark!
Tony Stark, also known as Iron Man, is a fictional character in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) media franchise. He is portrayed by Robert Downey Jr.
Tony Stark is a billionaire industrialist, a genius inventor, and a founding member of the Avengers. He is the CEO of Stark Industries, a leading technology company that develops advanced weapons and defense systems.
In the MCU, Tony Stark is a brilliant engineer and inventor who creates the Iron Man suit, a powerful exoskeleton that allows him to fly and fight crime. He later becomes a superhero, known as Iron Man, and joins the Avengers to fight against evil forces.
Tony Stark is known for his wit, intelligence, and charisma. He is a self-sacrificing hero who has made many sacrifices to protect the world from threats like Ultron, Thanos, and others.
Dushyant_yadav : breaf introduction of AI
EDITH : Here's a brief introduction to Artificial Intelligence (AI):
Artificial Intelligence (AI) is the ability of machines to replicate or enhance human intelligence, such as reasoning, learning, and problem-solving. It enables computers and machines to perform tasks that typically require human intelligence, like image analysis, speech recognition, and decision-making.
AI allows machines to learn from experience, adapt to new situations, and perform tasks with increased accuracy and speed. It has numerous applications in various industries, including healthcare, finance, education, and more.
